#: toplevel.cpp:58
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The application finder looks for non-KDE applications on your system and "
"adds them to the KDE menu system. Click 'Scan' to begin, select the desired "
"applications and then click 'Apply'."
msgstr ""
"Li troveu d' programes cwirt après les programes nén KDE k' i gn a sol "
"sistinme da vosse eyet les radjouter å menu sistinme da KDE. Clitchîz so "
"«Cweri» po cmincî l' cweraedje, tchoezixhoz adon les programes ki vos vloz, "
"et clitchîz so «Mete en ouve»."

